  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456981,
    "dDurationMs": 1854,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you keep feeding that\nback into the process,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458836,
    "dDurationMs": 3349,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you can basically\nsample large sequences."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462186,
    "dDurationMs": 1544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the end, you see\nthat the transformer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463731,
    "dDurationMs": 1409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has learned about words and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465141,
    "dDurationMs": 3089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where to put spaces and where\nto put commas and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468231,
    "dDurationMs": 719,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're making"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468951,
    "dDurationMs": 2164,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more and more consistent\npredictions over time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471116,
    "dDurationMs": 2004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are the plots\nthat you are looking at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473121,
    "dDurationMs": 1649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you're doing\nmodel pretraining."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474771,
    "dDurationMs": 1259,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Effectively, we're looking at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476031,
    "dDurationMs": 2479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the loss function over\ntime as you train,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478511,
    "dDurationMs": 2199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and low loss means\nthat our transformer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480711,
    "dDurationMs": 3129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is giving a higher probability"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483841,
    "dDurationMs": 3029,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the next correct\ninteger in the sequence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486871,
    "dDurationMs": 2099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What are we going\nto do with model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488971,
    "dDurationMs": 1749,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "once we've trained\nit after a month?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490721,
    "dDurationMs": 3474,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the first thing that\nwe noticed, we the field,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494196,
    "dDurationMs": 2104,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that these models"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496301,
    "dDurationMs": 2259,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "basically in the process\nof language modeling,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 498561,
    "dDurationMs": 2624,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "learn very powerful\ngeneral representations,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501186,
    "dDurationMs": 2459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's possible to very\nefficiently fine tune them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503646,
    "dDurationMs": 1664,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for any arbitrary\ndownstream tasks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505311,
    "dDurationMs": 1099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you might be interested in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506411,
    "dDurationMs": 1059,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As an example, if you're"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507471,
    "dDurationMs": 1754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "interested in sentiment\nclassification,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509226,
    "dDurationMs": 1994,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the approach used to be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511221,
    "dDurationMs": 1799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you collect a\nbunch of positives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513021,
    "dDurationMs": 2624,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and negatives and then you\ntrain some NLP model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515646,
    "dDurationMs": 2504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for that, but the\nnew approach is:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518151,
    "dDurationMs": 779,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ignore sentiment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518931,
    "dDurationMs": 2549,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "classification,\ngo off and do large"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521481,
    "dDurationMs": 1693,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "language model pretraining,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523175,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "train a large transformer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524736,
    "dDurationMs": 2894,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then you may only\nhave a few examples and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527631,
    "dDurationMs": 1349,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can very\nefficiently fine tune"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528981,
    "dDurationMs": 2059,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your model for that task."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531041,
    "dDurationMs": 2509,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This works very\nwell in practice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533551,
    "dDurationMs": 1549,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The reason for this\nis that basically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535101,
    "dDurationMs": 1529,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the transformer is forced to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536631,
    "dDurationMs": 1499,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "multitask a huge amount of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538131,
    "dDurationMs": 2284,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tasks in the language\nmodeling task,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540416,
    "dDurationMs": 2814,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because in terms of\npredicting the next token,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543231,
    "dDurationMs": 2159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's forced to understand a\nlot about the structure of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545391,
    "dDurationMs": 3729,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the text and all the\ndifferent concepts therein."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549350,
    "dDurationMs": 3230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was GPT-1. Now\naround the time of GPT-2,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552581,
    "dDurationMs": 1509,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people noticed that actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554091,
    "dDurationMs": 1319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even better than fine tuning,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555411,
    "dDurationMs": 2509,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can actually prompt these\nmodels very effectively."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557921,
    "dDurationMs": 1269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are language\nmodels and they want"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559191,
    "dDurationMs": 1409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to complete documents,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560601,
    "dDurationMs": 1829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can actually trick\nthem into performing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562431,
    "dDurationMs": 3189,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tasks by arranging\nthese fake documents."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565621,
    "dDurationMs": 2064,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this example, for example,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567686,
    "dDurationMs": 3339,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we have some passage and\nthen we like do QA, QA, QA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571026,
    "dDurationMs": 2384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is called Few-shot\nprompt, and then we do Q,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573411,
    "dDurationMs": 1859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then as the\ntransformer is tried to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575271,
    "dDurationMs": 2539,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "complete the document is\nactually answering our question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577811,
    "dDurationMs": 3009,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is an example of prompt\nengineering based model,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580821,
    "dDurationMs": 1739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "making it believe\nthat it's imitating"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582561,
    "dDurationMs": 3179,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a document and getting\nit to perform a task."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585741,
    "dDurationMs": 2894,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This kicked off, I think\nthe era of, I would say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588636,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "prompting over fine tuning\nand seeing that this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590931,
    "dDurationMs": 2444,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually can work extremely\nwell on a lot of problems,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593376,
    "dDurationMs": 1679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even without training\nany neural networks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595056,
    "dDurationMs": 1674,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fine tuning or so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596731,
    "dDurationMs": 1924,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now since then, we've seen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598656,
    "dDurationMs": 1544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an entire evolutionary tree of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600201,
    "dDurationMs": 2324,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "base models that\neveryone has trained."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602526,
    "dDurationMs": 2594,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not all of these\nmodels are available."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605121,
    "dDurationMs": 3119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for example, the GPT-4 base\nmodel was never released."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608241,
    "dDurationMs": 1439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The GPT-4 model\nthat you might be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 609681,
    "dDurationMs": 2324,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "interacting with over\nAPI is not a base model,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612006,
    "dDurationMs": 1224,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's an assistant model,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613231,
    "dDurationMs": 2569,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we're going to cover\nhow to get those in a bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615801,
    "dDurationMs": 3599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GPT-3 based model is\navailable via the API under"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619401,
    "dDurationMs": 2429,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the name Devanshi and\nGPT-2 based model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621831,
    "dDurationMs": 2564,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is available even as\nweights on our GitHub repo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624396,
    "dDurationMs": 2834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But currently the best\navailable base model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 627231,
    "dDurationMs": 2714,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "probably is the LLaMA\nseries from Meta,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629946,
    "dDurationMs": 2664,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "although it is not\ncommercially licensed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632879,
    "dDurationMs": 1541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, one thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634421,
    "dDurationMs": 734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to point out is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635156,
    "dDurationMs": 1589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "base models are not assistants."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636746,
    "dDurationMs": 4364,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't want to make\nanswers to your questions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641111,
    "dDurationMs": 1889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they want to complete documents."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643001,
    "dDurationMs": 1589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you tell them to write"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644591,
    "dDurationMs": 1559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a poem about the\nbread and cheese,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646151,
    "dDurationMs": 3104,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it will answer questions\nwith more questions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 649256,
    "dDurationMs": 2129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's completing what it\nthinks is a document."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 651386,
    "dDurationMs": 2714,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, you can prompt\nthem in a specific way for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654101,
    "dDurationMs": 3434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "base models that is\nmore likely to work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657536,
    "dDurationMs": 2219,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As an example, here's a poem\nabout bread and cheese,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659756,
    "dDurationMs": 2684,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and in that case it will\nautocomplete correctly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662441,
    "dDurationMs": 3779,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can even trick base\nmodels into being assistants."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666221,
    "dDurationMs": 1784,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The way you would do\nthis is you would create"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668006,
    "dDurationMs": 1874,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a specific few-shot prompt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669881,
    "dDurationMs": 1199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that makes it look like there's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671081,
    "dDurationMs": 2159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some document between\nthe human and assistant"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673241,
    "dDurationMs": 3074,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they're exchanging\ninformation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676316,
    "dDurationMs": 1544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then at the bottom,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677861,
    "dDurationMs": 3149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you put your query at the\nend and the base model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681011,
    "dDurationMs": 2369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will condition itself into"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 683381,
    "dDurationMs": 3269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "being a helpful\nassistant and answer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686651,
    "dDurationMs": 1859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but this is not very\nreliable and doesn't work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688511,
    "dDurationMs": 2279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "super well in practice,\nalthough it can be done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690791,
    "dDurationMs": 2129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, we have a\ndifferent path to make"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692921,
    "dDurationMs": 4184,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actual GPT assistants not base\nmodel document completers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697106,
    "dDurationMs": 2414,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That takes us into\nsupervised finetuning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699521,
    "dDurationMs": 2039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the supervised\nfinetuning stage,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701561,
    "dDurationMs": 1454,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we are going to collect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703016,
    "dDurationMs": 2924,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "small but high quality\ndata-sets, and in this case,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705941,
    "dDurationMs": 3029,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're going to ask human\ncontractors to gather data of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708971,
    "dDurationMs": 3809,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the form prompt and\nideal response."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712781,
    "dDurationMs": 1259,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're going to\ncollect lots of these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714041,
    "dDurationMs": 2504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "typically tens of thousands\nor something like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716546,
    "dDurationMs": 1784,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then we're going to\nstill do language"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718331,
    "dDurationMs": 1184,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "modeling on this data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719516,
    "dDurationMs": 1529,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nothing changed algorithmically,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 721046,
    "dDurationMs": 1814,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we're swapping out\na training set."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722861,
    "dDurationMs": 1679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It used to be\nInternet documents,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724541,
    "dDurationMs": 2309,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which has a high quantity local"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726851,
    "dDurationMs": 4559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for basically Q8 prompt\nresponse data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731411,
    "dDurationMs": 2474,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is low quantity,\nhigh quality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733886,
    "dDurationMs": 1619,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We will still do\nlanguage modeling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735506,
    "dDurationMs": 1184,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then after training,"
