  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1383911,
    "dDurationMs": 3899,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stripped and unlike you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1387811,
    "dDurationMs": 1889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the GPT will look at\nevery single token and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1389701,
    "dDurationMs": 2369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "spend the same amount of\ncompute on every one of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1392071,
    "dDurationMs": 1499,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, you can't expect it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1393571,
    "dDurationMs": 7439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to do too much work per token\nand also in particular,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1401011,
    "dDurationMs": 1199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "basically these transformers are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1402211,
    "dDurationMs": 1769,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just like token simulators,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1403981,
    "dDurationMs": 2099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they don't know what\nthey don't know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1406081,
    "dDurationMs": 1739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They just imitate\nthe next token."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1407821,
    "dDurationMs": 1964,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't know what they're\ngood at or not good at."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1409786,
    "dDurationMs": 2309,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They just tried their best\nto imitate the next token."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1412096,
    "dDurationMs": 1994,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't reflect in the loop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1414091,
    "dDurationMs": 1409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't sanity\ncheck anything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1415501,
    "dDurationMs": 1784,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't correct their\nmistakes along the way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1417286,
    "dDurationMs": 3314,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By default, they just are\nsample token sequences."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1420601,
    "dDurationMs": 2459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They don't have separate\ninner monologue streams"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423061,
    "dDurationMs": 839,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in their head right? They're"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423901,
    "dDurationMs": 1439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "evaluating what's happening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1425341,
    "dDurationMs": 3104,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, they do have some\ncognitive advantages,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1428446,
    "dDurationMs": 2564,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would say and that is\nthat they do actually have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1431011,
    "dDurationMs": 1754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a very large\nfact-based knowledge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1432766,
    "dDurationMs": 2369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across a vast number of\nareas because they have,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1435136,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "say, several, 10\nbillion parameters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1437071,
    "dDurationMs": 2834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a lot of storage\nfor a lot of facts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1439906,
    "dDurationMs": 2144,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They also, I think have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1442051,
    "dDurationMs": 2654,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a relatively large and\nperfect working memory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1444706,
    "dDurationMs": 3194,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whatever fits into\nthe context window"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1447901,
    "dDurationMs": 1589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is immediately available to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1449491,
    "dDurationMs": 1019,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the transformer through"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1450511,
    "dDurationMs": 1889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "its internal self\nattention mechanism"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452401,
    "dDurationMs": 2489,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so it's perfect memory,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1454891,
    "dDurationMs": 1529,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's got a finite size,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1456421,
    "dDurationMs": 1829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the transformer has\na very direct access"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1458251,
    "dDurationMs": 1289,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to it and so it can a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1459541,
    "dDurationMs": 2459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "losslessly remember\nanything that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1462001,
    "dDurationMs": 1694,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is inside its context window."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1463696,
    "dDurationMs": 2744,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is how I would compare\nthose two and the reason I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1466441,
    "dDurationMs": 1229,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bring all of this\nup is because I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1467671,
    "dDurationMs": 1559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "think to a large extent,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1469231,
    "dDurationMs": 2339,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "prompting is just making up for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1471571,
    "dDurationMs": 2579,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this cognitive\ndifference between"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1474151,
    "dDurationMs": 3284,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these two architectures like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1477436,
    "dDurationMs": 2084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our brains here and LLM brains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1479521,
    "dDurationMs": 2159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can look at it\nthat way almost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1481681,
    "dDurationMs": 2339,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's one thing that\npeople found for example"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1484021,
    "dDurationMs": 1289,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "works pretty well in practice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1485311,
    "dDurationMs": 2879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Especially if your tasks\nrequire reasoning,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1488191,
    "dDurationMs": 1469,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can't expect the transformer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1489661,
    "dDurationMs": 2699,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to do too much\nreasoning per token."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1492361,
    "dDurationMs": 1409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to really spread out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1493771,
    "dDurationMs": 2279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the reasoning across\nmore and more tokens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1496051,
    "dDurationMs": 1649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, you can't\ngive a transformer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1497701,
    "dDurationMs": 1439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a very complicated question and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1499141,
    "dDurationMs": 1829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "expect it to get the\nanswer in a single token."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1500971,
    "dDurationMs": 1574,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's just not\nenough time for it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1502546,
    "dDurationMs": 1814,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"These transformers\nneed tokens to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1504361,
    "dDurationMs": 2624,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "think,\" I like to say sometimes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1506986,
    "dDurationMs": 1889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is some of the\nthings that work well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1508876,
    "dDurationMs": 2069,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you may for example have\na few-shot prompt that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1510946,
    "dDurationMs": 1994,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shows the transformer\nthat it should show"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1512941,
    "dDurationMs": 1139,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "its work when it's answering"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1514081,
    "dDurationMs": 3089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "question and if you\ngive a few examples,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1517171,
    "dDurationMs": 3299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the transformer will imitate\nthat template and it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1520471,
    "dDurationMs": 1409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will just end up working out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1521881,
    "dDurationMs": 2339,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "better in terms of\nits evaluation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1524221,
    "dDurationMs": 2489,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Additionally, you can\nelicit this behavior from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1526711,
    "dDurationMs": 2564,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the transformer by saying,\nlet things step-by-step."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1529276,
    "dDurationMs": 3614,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because this conditions the\ntransformer into showing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1532891,
    "dDurationMs": 1394,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "its work and because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1534286,
    "dDurationMs": 2549,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it snaps into a mode\nof showing its work,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1536836,
    "dDurationMs": 3449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is going to do less\ncomputational work per token."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1540286,
    "dDurationMs": 2654,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's more likely to succeed\nas a result because it's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1542941,
    "dDurationMs": 3074,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "making slower\nreasoning over time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1546016,
    "dDurationMs": 1844,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's another example, this one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1547861,
    "dDurationMs": 1604,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is called self-consistency."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1549466,
    "dDurationMs": 2234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We saw that we had the ability"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1551701,
    "dDurationMs": 2414,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to start writing and then\nif it didn't work out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1554116,
    "dDurationMs": 2654,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can try again and I\ncan try multiple times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1556771,
    "dDurationMs": 3989,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and maybe select the\none that worked best."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1560761,
    "dDurationMs": 1664,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In these approaches,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1562426,
    "dDurationMs": 1364,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you may sample not just once,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1563791,
    "dDurationMs": 1769,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you may sample\nmultiple times and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1565561,
    "dDurationMs": 1979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then have some\nprocess for finding"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1567541,
    "dDurationMs": 1679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the ones that are\ngood and then keeping"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1569221,
    "dDurationMs": 1019,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just those samples or doing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1570241,
    "dDurationMs": 1724,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a majority vote or\nsomething like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1571966,
    "dDurationMs": 2174,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Basically these transformers\nin the process as"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1574141,
    "dDurationMs": 2789,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they predict the next\ntoken, just like you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1576931,
    "dDurationMs": 1094,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they can get unlucky"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1578026,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they could sample\na not a very good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1579961,
    "dDurationMs": 1769,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "token and they can go down like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1581731,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a blind alley in\nterms of reasoning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1584401,
    "dDurationMs": 2864,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unlike you, they cannot\nrecover from that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1587266,
    "dDurationMs": 1724,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are stuck with\nevery single token they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1588991,
    "dDurationMs": 2054,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sample and so they will\ncontinue the sequence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1591046,
    "dDurationMs": 1184,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if they know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1592231,
    "dDurationMs": 1964,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that this sequence is\nnot going to work out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1594196,
    "dDurationMs": 2249,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Give them the ability\nto look back,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1596446,
    "dDurationMs": 4289,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "inspect or try to basically\nsample around it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1600736,
    "dDurationMs": 2354,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's one technique also,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1603091,
    "dDurationMs": 2354,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it turns out that actually LLMs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1605446,
    "dDurationMs": 1889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they know when\nthey've screwed up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1607336,
    "dDurationMs": 3464,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so as an example, say\nyou ask the model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1610801,
    "dDurationMs": 1739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to generate a poem that does not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1612541,
    "dDurationMs": 2009,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rhyme and it might\ngive you a poem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1614551,
    "dDurationMs": 1364,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it actually rhymes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1615916,
    "dDurationMs": 1364,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it turns out\nthat especially for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1617281,
    "dDurationMs": 1574,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the bigger models like GPT-4,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1618856,
    "dDurationMs": 2264,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can just ask it \"did you\nmeet the assignment?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1621121,
    "dDurationMs": 2069,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Actually GPT-4 knows very"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1623191,
    "dDurationMs": 1634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well that it did not\nmeet the assignment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1624826,
    "dDurationMs": 2414,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It just got unlucky\nin its sampling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1627241,
    "dDurationMs": 1679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It will tell you, \"No,\nI didn't actually meet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1628921,
    "dDurationMs": 1859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the assignment here.\nLet me try again.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1630781,
    "dDurationMs": 1529,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But without you prompting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1632311,
    "dDurationMs": 5669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it it doesn't know to\nrevisit and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1637981,
    "dDurationMs": 1904,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to make up for\nthat in your prompts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1639886,
    "dDurationMs": 1979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you have to get it to check,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1641866,
    "dDurationMs": 1184,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you don't ask it to check,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1643051,
    "dDurationMs": 1199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "its not going to check by itself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1644251,
    "dDurationMs": 2079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's just a token simulator."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1648169,
    "dDurationMs": 1691,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think more generally,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1649861,
    "dDurationMs": 1529,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a lot of these\ntechniques fall into"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1651391,
    "dDurationMs": 3239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the bucket of what I would\nsay recreating our System 2."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1654631,
    "dDurationMs": 1619,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You might be familiar\nwith the System 1 and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1656251,
    "dDurationMs": 1634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "System 2 thinking for humans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1657886,
    "dDurationMs": 2474,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "System 1 is a fast\nautomatic process and I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1660361,
    "dDurationMs": 3254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "think corresponds to an\nLLM just sampling tokens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1663616,
    "dDurationMs": 2489,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "System 2 is the\nslower deliberate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1666106,
    "dDurationMs": 3149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "planning part of your brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1669256,
    "dDurationMs": 1874,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a paper actually from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1671131,
    "dDurationMs": 1109,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just last week because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1672241,
    "dDurationMs": 1544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this space is pretty\nquickly evolving,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1673786,
    "dDurationMs": 2244,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's called Tree of Thought."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1676340,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The authors of this paper\nproposed maintaining"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1679201,
    "dDurationMs": 2969,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "multiple completions\nfor any given prompt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1682171,
    "dDurationMs": 2279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then they are also\nscoring them along"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1684451,
    "dDurationMs": 1649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the way and keeping\nthe ones that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1686101,
    "dDurationMs": 2279,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are going well if\nthat makes sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1688381,
    "dDurationMs": 1979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A lot of people\nare really playing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1690361,
    "dDurationMs": 3134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around with prompt engineering"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1693496,
    "dDurationMs": 2474,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to basically bring back some of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1695971,
    "dDurationMs": 3569,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these abilities that we\nhave in our brain for LLMs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1699541,
    "dDurationMs": 1649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, one thing I\nwould like to note"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1701191,
    "dDurationMs": 1589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here is that this is\nnot just a prompt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1702781,
    "dDurationMs": 2759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is actually prompts\nthat are together"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1705541,
    "dDurationMs": 2969,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "used with some Python\nGlue code because you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1708511,
    "dDurationMs": 1079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually have to\nmaintain multiple"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1709591,
    "dDurationMs": 1229,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "prompts and you also have to do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1710821,
    "dDurationMs": 1784,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some tree search algorithm here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1712606,
    "dDurationMs": 2774,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to figure out which\nprompts to expand, etc."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1715381,
    "dDurationMs": 2759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a symbiosis of\nPython Glue code and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1718141,
    "dDurationMs": 1319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "individual prompts that are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1719461,
    "dDurationMs": 2574,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "called in a while loop or\nin a bigger algorithm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1722036,
    "dDurationMs": 1554,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also think there's\na really cool"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1723591,
    "dDurationMs": 1394,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "parallel here to AlphaGo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1724986,
    "dDurationMs": 1664,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AlphaGo has a policy for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1726651,
    "dDurationMs": 2264,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "placing the next stone\nwhen it plays go,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1728916,
    "dDurationMs": 1229,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and its policy was trained"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1730146,
    "dDurationMs": 2239,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "originally by imitating humans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1732386,
    "dDurationMs": 1834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in addition to this policy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1734221,
    "dDurationMs": 2369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it also does Monte\nCarlo Tree Search."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1736591,
    "dDurationMs": 2459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Basically, it will play out\na number of possibilities in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1739051,
    "dDurationMs": 1289,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "its head and evaluate all of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1740341,
    "dDurationMs": 1634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "them and only keep the\nones that work well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1741976,
    "dDurationMs": 2039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think this is an equivalent of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1744016,
    "dDurationMs": 4164,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "AlphaGo but for text\nif that makes sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1748190,
    "dDurationMs": 2155,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just like Tree of Thought,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1750346,
    "dDurationMs": 1424,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think more\ngenerally people are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1751771,
    "dDurationMs": 1889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "starting to really explore"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1753661,
    "dDurationMs": 1859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more general techniques of not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1755521,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just the simple\nquestion-answer prompts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1757456,
    "dDurationMs": 1694,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but something that\nlooks a lot more like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1759151,
    "dDurationMs": 2909,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Python Glue code stringing\ntogether many prompts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1762061,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the right, I have\nan example from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1763981,
    "dDurationMs": 1709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this paper called\nReact where they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1765691,
    "dDurationMs": 3209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "structure the answer to a prompt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1768901,
    "dDurationMs": 3554,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a sequence of\nthought-action-observation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1772456,
    "dDurationMs": 2054,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thought-action-observation,\nand it's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1774511,
    "dDurationMs": 1214,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a full rollout and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1775726,
    "dDurationMs": 2699,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a thinking process\nto answer the query."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1778426,
    "dDurationMs": 3699,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In these actions, the model\nis also allowed to tool use."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1782126,
    "dDurationMs": 3264,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the left, I have an\nexample of AutoGPT."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1785391,
    "dDurationMs": 2579,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now AutoGPT by the way is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1787971,
    "dDurationMs": 3749,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a project that I think got\na lot of hype recently,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1791721,
    "dDurationMs": 3419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I think I still find it\ninspirationally interesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1795141,
    "dDurationMs": 3369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a project that\nallows an LLM to keep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1798511,
    "dDurationMs": 1679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the task list and continue to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1800191,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "recursively break down tasks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1802126,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think this currently\nworks very well and I would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1804061,
    "dDurationMs": 3044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not advise people to use it\nin practical applications."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1807106,
    "dDurationMs": 1994,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just think it's something\nto generally take inspiration"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1809101,
    "dDurationMs": 3189,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from in terms of where this\nis going, I think over time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1812540,
    "dDurationMs": 3625,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's like giving our\nmodel System 2 thinking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1816166,
    "dDurationMs": 2834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next thing I\nfind interesting is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1819001,
    "dDurationMs": 1769,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this following serve I would say"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1820771,
    "dDurationMs": 2444,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "almost psychological\nquirk of LLMs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1823216,
    "dDurationMs": 2984,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that LLMs don't\nwant to succeed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1826201,
    "dDurationMs": 1904,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they want to imitate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1828106,
    "dDurationMs": 2999,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You want to succeed, and\nyou should ask for it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1831106,
    "dDurationMs": 2219,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I mean by that is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1833326,
    "dDurationMs": 1829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when transformers are trained,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1835156,
    "dDurationMs": 2924,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they have training\nsets and there can be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1838081,
    "dDurationMs": 1244,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an entire spectrum of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1839326,
    "dDurationMs": 2174,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "performance qualities\nin their training data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1841501,
    "dDurationMs": 1739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, there could\nbe some kind of a prompt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1843241,
    "dDurationMs": 2174,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for some physics question\nor something like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1845416,
    "dDurationMs": 554,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there could be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1845971,
    "dDurationMs": 1844,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a student's solution\nthat is completely wrong"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1847816,
    "dDurationMs": 1364,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there can also be an expert"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1849181,
    "dDurationMs": 1769,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "answer that is extremely right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1850951,
    "dDurationMs": 3599,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Transformers can't tell the\ndifference between low,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1854551,
    "dDurationMs": 2219,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they know about\nlow-quality solutions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1856771,
    "dDurationMs": 1184,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and high-quality solutions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1857956,
    "dDurationMs": 1904,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but by default, they\nwant to imitate all of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1859861,
    "dDurationMs": 2564,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it because they're just\ntrained on language modeling."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1862426,
    "dDurationMs": 1844,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At test time, you actually have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1864271,
    "dDurationMs": 1844,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to ask for a good performance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1866116,
    "dDurationMs": 2249,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this example in this paper,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1868366,
    "dDurationMs": 2519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they tried various prompts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1870886,
    "dDurationMs": 2144,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's think step-by-step\nwas very powerful"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1873031,
    "dDurationMs": 2624,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it spread out the\nreasoning over many tokens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1875656,
    "dDurationMs": 1664,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what worked even better is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1877321,
    "dDurationMs": 1904,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let's work this out\nin a step-by-step way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1879226,
    "dDurationMs": 1679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be sure we have\nthe right answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1880906,
    "dDurationMs": 2804,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like conditioning on\ngetting the right answer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1883711,
    "dDurationMs": 1679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and this actually makes\nthe transformer work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1885391,
    "dDurationMs": 1889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "better because the\ntransformer doesn't have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1887281,
    "dDurationMs": 2474,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to now hedge its\nprobability mass"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1889756,
    "dDurationMs": 1439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on low-quality solutions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1891196,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as ridiculous as that sounds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1893116,
    "dDurationMs": 4109,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Basically, feel free to\nask for a strong solution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1897226,
    "dDurationMs": 1124,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Say something like, you are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1898351,
    "dDurationMs": 1409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a leading expert on this topic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1899761,
    "dDurationMs": 2174,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pretend you have IQ 120, etc."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1901936,
    "dDurationMs": 2144,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But don't try to ask for\ntoo much IQ because if"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1904081,
    "dDurationMs": 2249,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you ask for IQ 400,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1906331,
    "dDurationMs": 1964,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you might be out of\ndata distribution,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1908296,
    "dDurationMs": 2984,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or even worse, you could be\nin data distribution for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1911281,
    "dDurationMs": 1439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something like\nsci-fi stuff and it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1912721,
    "dDurationMs": 1559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will start to take\non some sci-fi,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1914281,
    "dDurationMs": 2699,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or like roleplaying or\nsomething like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1916981,
    "dDurationMs": 2504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to find the\nright amount of IQ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1919486,
    "dDurationMs": 3029,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's got some\nU-shaped curve there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1922516,
    "dDurationMs": 2384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next up, as we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1924901,
    "dDurationMs": 2129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "saw when we are trying\nto solve problems,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1927031,
    "dDurationMs": 2759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we know what we are good at\nand what we're not good at,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1929791,
    "dDurationMs": 2234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we lean on tools\ncomputationally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1932026,
    "dDurationMs": 3284,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You want to do the same\npotentially with your LLMs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1935311,
    "dDurationMs": 3089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In particular, we\nmay want to give"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1938401,
    "dDurationMs": 2594,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "them calculators,\ncode interpreters,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1940996,
    "dDurationMs": 2684,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so on, the\nability to do search,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1943681,
    "dDurationMs": 3394,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's a lot of\ntechniques for doing that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1947076,
    "dDurationMs": 1409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One thing to keep\nin mind, again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1948486,
    "dDurationMs": 1964,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that these transformers\nby default may"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1950451,
    "dDurationMs": 2489,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not know what they don't know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1952941,
    "dDurationMs": 1739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You may even want to\ntell the transformer in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1954681,
    "dDurationMs": 2899,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a prompt you are not very\ngood at mental arithmetic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1957581,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whenever you need to do\nvery large number addition,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1960001,
    "dDurationMs": 1064,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "multiplication, or whatever,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1961066,
    "dDurationMs": 1424,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instead, use this calculator."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1962491,
    "dDurationMs": 1319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's how you use\nthe calculator,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1963811,
    "dDurationMs": 2454,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you use this token\ncombination, etc."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1966266,
    "dDurationMs": 2224,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to actually spell\nit out because the model by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1968491,
    "dDurationMs": 2369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "default doesn't know what\nit's good at or not good at,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1970861,
    "dDurationMs": 3749,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "necessarily, just like\nyou and I might be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1974660,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next up, I think\nsomething that is very"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1976921,
    "dDurationMs": 1484,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "interesting is we went from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1978406,
    "dDurationMs": 3809,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a world that was retrieval\nonly all the way,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1982216,
    "dDurationMs": 1754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the pendulum has swung\nto the other extreme"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1983971,
    "dDurationMs": 2144,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where its memory only in LLMs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1986116,
    "dDurationMs": 2759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But actually, there's this\nentire space in-between of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1988876,
    "dDurationMs": 1994,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these retrieval-augmented\nmodels and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1990871,
    "dDurationMs": 2039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this works extremely\nwell in practice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1992911,
    "dDurationMs": 1769,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As I mentioned, the\ncontext window of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1994681,
    "dDurationMs": 2339,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a transformer is\nits working memory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1997021,
    "dDurationMs": 1844,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you can load\nthe working memory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1998866,
    "dDurationMs": 2489,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with any information that\nis relevant to the task,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2001356,
    "dDurationMs": 1844,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the model will work\nextremely well"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2003201,
    "dDurationMs": 3134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it can immediately\naccess all that memory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2006336,
    "dDurationMs": 2444,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think a lot of people\nare really interested"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2008781,
    "dDurationMs": 4199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in basically retrieval-augment\ndegeneration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2012981,
    "dDurationMs": 2879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the bottom, I have an\nexample of LlamaIndex which is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2015861,
    "dDurationMs": 2999,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one data connector to lots\nof different types of data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2018861,
    "dDurationMs": 2849,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can index all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2021711,
    "dDurationMs": 2489,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of that data and you can\nmake it accessible to LLMs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2024201,
    "dDurationMs": 3434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The emerging recipe there is\nyou take relevant documents,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2027636,
    "dDurationMs": 1409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you split them up into chunks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2029046,
    "dDurationMs": 1454,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you embed all of them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2030501,
    "dDurationMs": 1529,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you basically get\nembedding vectors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2032031,
    "dDurationMs": 1289,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that represent that data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2033321,
    "dDurationMs": 2894,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You store that in the vector\nstore and then at test time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2036216,
    "dDurationMs": 1394,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you make some kind of a query to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2037611,
    "dDurationMs": 2399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your vector store and\nyou fetch chunks that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2040011,
    "dDurationMs": 1889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "might be relevant\nto your task and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2041901,
    "dDurationMs": 2159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you stuff them into the\nprompt and then you generate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2044061,
    "dDurationMs": 2324,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This can work quite\nwell in practice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2046386,
    "dDurationMs": 1484,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is, I think, similar to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2047871,
    "dDurationMs": 1484,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you and I solve problems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2049356,
    "dDurationMs": 2099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can do everything\nfrom your memory and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2051456,
    "dDurationMs": 2189,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "transformers have very\nlarge and extensive memory,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2053646,
    "dDurationMs": 1304,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but also it really helps to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2054951,
    "dDurationMs": 2879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reference some\nprimary documents."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2057831,
    "dDurationMs": 1589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whenever you find yourself going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2059421,
    "dDurationMs": 1604,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "back to a textbook\nto find something,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2061026,
    "dDurationMs": 1664,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or whenever you find\nyourself going back to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2062691,
    "dDurationMs": 2309,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "documentation of the library\nto look something up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2065001,
    "dDurationMs": 2609,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "transformers definitely\nwant to do that too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2067611,
    "dDurationMs": 2459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have some memory over how"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2070071,
    "dDurationMs": 1409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some documentation\nof the library"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2071481,
    "dDurationMs": 1799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "works but it's much\nbetter to look it up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2073281,
    "dDurationMs": 2559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The same applies here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2075940,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next, I wanted to briefly talk"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2078111,
    "dDurationMs": 1574,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about constraint prompting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2079686,
    "dDurationMs": 1949,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also find this\nvery interesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2081636,
    "dDurationMs": 2324,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is basically techniques"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2083961,
    "dDurationMs": 6374,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for forcing a certain template\nin the outputs of LLMs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2090336,
    "dDurationMs": 3119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Guidance is one example\nfrom Microsoft actually."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2093456,
    "dDurationMs": 1844,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here we are enforcing that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2095301,
    "dDurationMs": 2504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the output from the\nLLM will be JSON."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2097806,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This will actually\nguarantee that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2100101,
    "dDurationMs": 2099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the output will take on\nthis form because they go"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2102201,
    "dDurationMs": 1469,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in and they mess with\nthe probabilities of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2103671,
    "dDurationMs": 959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all the different tokens that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2104631,
    "dDurationMs": 1169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "come out of the transformer and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2105801,
    "dDurationMs": 2009,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they clamp those tokens and then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2107811,
    "dDurationMs": 2129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the transformer is only\nfilling in the blanks here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2109941,
    "dDurationMs": 1739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then you can enforce\nadditional restrictions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2111681,
    "dDurationMs": 1754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on what could go\ninto those blanks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2113436,
    "dDurationMs": 1874,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This might be really\nhelpful, and I think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2115311,
    "dDurationMs": 3099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this constraint sampling is\nalso extremely interesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2119219,
    "dDurationMs": 1691,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also want to say"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2120911,
    "dDurationMs": 1409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a few words about fine tuning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2122321,
    "dDurationMs": 1619,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the case that\nyou can get really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2123941,
    "dDurationMs": 1949,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "far with prompt engineering,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2125891,
    "dDurationMs": 1619,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's also possible to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2127511,
    "dDurationMs": 1904,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "think about fine\ntuning your models."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2129416,
    "dDurationMs": 2174,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, fine tuning\nmodels means that you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2131591,
    "dDurationMs": 2369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are actually going to change\nthe weights of the model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2133961,
    "dDurationMs": 1469,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is becoming a lot more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2135431,
    "dDurationMs": 1799,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "accessible to do\nthis in practice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2137231,
    "dDurationMs": 1589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's because of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2138821,
    "dDurationMs": 959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a number of techniques\nthat have been"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2139781,
    "dDurationMs": 3269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "developed and have libraries\nfor very recently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2143051,
    "dDurationMs": 1439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for example\nparameter efficient"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2144491,
    "dDurationMs": 1679,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fine tuning techniques\nlike Laura,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2146171,
    "dDurationMs": 3149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make sure that you're\nonly training small,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2149321,
    "dDurationMs": 1694,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sparse pieces of your model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2151016,
    "dDurationMs": 1994,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So most of the model\nis kept clamped at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2153011,
    "dDurationMs": 2429,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the base model and some\npieces of it are allowed to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2155441,
    "dDurationMs": 1409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "change and this\nstill works pretty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2156851,
    "dDurationMs": 1499,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well empirically and makes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2158351,
    "dDurationMs": 3869,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it much cheaper to tune only\nsmall pieces of your model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2162221,
    "dDurationMs": 3479,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It also means that because\nmost of your model is clamped,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2165701,
    "dDurationMs": 2099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can use very low\nprecision inference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2167801,
    "dDurationMs": 1889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for computing those\nparts because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2169691,
    "dDurationMs": 1079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you are not going\nto be updated by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2170771,
    "dDurationMs": 1409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gradient descent and so that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2172181,
    "dDurationMs": 1784,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "makes everything a lot\nmore efficient as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2173966,
    "dDurationMs": 1784,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in addition, we\nhave a number of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2175751,
    "dDurationMs": 1709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "open source, high-quality\nbase models."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2177461,
    "dDurationMs": 1199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Currently, as I mentioned,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2178661,
    "dDurationMs": 1499,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think LLaMa is quite nice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2180161,
    "dDurationMs": 1439,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "although it is not commercially"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2181601,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "licensed, I believe right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2183521,
    "dDurationMs": 3149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some things to keep in\nmind is that basically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2186671,
    "dDurationMs": 2774,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fine tuning is a lot more\ntechnically involved."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2189446,
    "dDurationMs": 1454,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It requires a lot more, I think,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2190901,
    "dDurationMs": 1769,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "technical expertise to do right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2192671,
    "dDurationMs": 2309,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It requires human\ndata contractors for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2194981,
    "dDurationMs": 2009,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "datasets and/or\nsynthetic data pipelines"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2196991,
    "dDurationMs": 1394,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can be pretty complicated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2198386,
    "dDurationMs": 1634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This will definitely slow down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2200021,
    "dDurationMs": 1664,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your iteration cycle by a lot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2201686,
    "dDurationMs": 2834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I would say on\na high level SFT is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2204521,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "achievable because\nyou're continuing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2207191,
    "dDurationMs": 1049,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the language modeling task."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2208241,
    "dDurationMs": 2399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's relatively\nstraightforward, but RLHF,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2210641,
    "dDurationMs": 2519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would say is very\nmuch research territory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2213161,
    "dDurationMs": 2579,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and is even much\nharder to get to work,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2215741,
    "dDurationMs": 2369,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so I would probably\nnot advise that someone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2218111,
    "dDurationMs": 2459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just tries to roll their own\nRLHF of implementation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2220571,
    "dDurationMs": 1469,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These things are\npretty unstable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2222041,
    "dDurationMs": 2639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very difficult to train, not\nsomething that is, I think,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2224681,
    "dDurationMs": 1319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very beginner\nfriendly right now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2226001,
    "dDurationMs": 2099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's also\npotentially likely also"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2228101,
    "dDurationMs": 3179,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to change pretty rapidly still."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2231281,
    "dDurationMs": 1589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think these are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2232871,
    "dDurationMs": 2564,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my default recommendations\nright now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2235436,
    "dDurationMs": 2879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would break up your task\ninto two major parts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2238316,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number 1, achieve\nyour top performance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2240611,
    "dDurationMs": 3374,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Number 2, optimize your\nperformance in that order."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2243986,
    "dDurationMs": 1904,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number 1, the best\nperformance will"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2245891,
    "dDurationMs": 1664,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "currently come from GPT-4 model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2247556,
    "dDurationMs": 2099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the most capable\nof all by far."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2249656,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Use prompts that\nare very detailed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2251951,
    "dDurationMs": 1769,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have lots of\ntask content,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2253721,
    "dDurationMs": 2519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "relevant information\nand instructions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2256241,
    "dDurationMs": 1889,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think along the lines\nof what would you tell"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2258131,
    "dDurationMs": 2519,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a task contractor if they\ncan't email you back,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2260651,
    "dDurationMs": 2459,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then also keep in mind\nthat a task contractor is a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2263111,
    "dDurationMs": 1049,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "human and they have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2264161,
    "dDurationMs": 1979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "inner monologue and\nthey're very clever, etc."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2266141,
    "dDurationMs": 2384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "LLMs do not possess\nthose qualities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2268526,
    "dDurationMs": 2354,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So make sure to think through"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2270881,
    "dDurationMs": 1364,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the psychology of the LLM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2272246,
    "dDurationMs": 2684,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "almost and cater\nprompts to that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2274931,
    "dDurationMs": 2534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Retrieve and add any\nrelevant context"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2277466,
    "dDurationMs": 2144,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and information\nto these prompts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2279611,
    "dDurationMs": 1979,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Basically refer to a lot of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2281591,
    "dDurationMs": 1379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the prompt engineering\ntechniques."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2282971,
    "dDurationMs": 1994,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some of them I've highlighted\nin the slides above,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2284966,
    "dDurationMs": 2954,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but also this is a very\nlarge space and I would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2287921,
    "dDurationMs": 1709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just advise you to look"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2289631,
    "dDurationMs": 1949,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for prompt engineering\ntechniques online."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2291581,
    "dDurationMs": 1694,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a lot to cover there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2293276,
    "dDurationMs": 2354,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Experiment with\nfew-shot examples."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2295631,
    "dDurationMs": 2084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What this refers to is, you\ndon't just want to tell,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2297716,
    "dDurationMs": 2024,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you want to show\nwhenever it's possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2299741,
    "dDurationMs": 2084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So give it examples\nof everything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2301826,
    "dDurationMs": 3314,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that helps it really understand\nwhat you mean if you can."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2305141,
    "dDurationMs": 2009,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Experiment with tools\nand plug-ins to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2307151,
    "dDurationMs": 3269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "offload tasks that are\ndifficult for LLMs natively,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2310421,
    "dDurationMs": 1769,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then think about not just a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2312191,
    "dDurationMs": 1259,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "single prompt and answer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2313451,
    "dDurationMs": 1514,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "think about potential chains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2314966,
    "dDurationMs": 1514,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and reflection and how you glue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2316481,
    "dDurationMs": 1199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "them together and how you can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2317681,
    "dDurationMs": 2444,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "potentially make multiple\nsamples and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2320126,
    "dDurationMs": 2084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Finally, if you think\nyou've squeezed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2322211,
    "dDurationMs": 1109,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out prompt engineering,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2323321,
    "dDurationMs": 2414,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which I think you should\nstick with for a while,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2325736,
    "dDurationMs": 2849,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "look at some potentially"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2328586,
    "dDurationMs": 2759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fine tuning a model\nto your application,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2331346,
    "dDurationMs": 1604,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but expect this to be a lot more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2332951,
    "dDurationMs": 1709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "slower in the vault and then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2334661,
    "dDurationMs": 1829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's an expert\nfragile research zone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2336491,
    "dDurationMs": 1814,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here and I would\nsay that is RLHF,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2338306,
    "dDurationMs": 1844,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which currently does work a bit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2340151,
    "dDurationMs": 2069,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "better than SFT if you\ncan get it to work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2342221,
    "dDurationMs": 2819,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But again, this is pretty\ninvolved, I would say."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2345041,
    "dDurationMs": 1394,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to optimize your costs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2346436,
    "dDurationMs": 2654,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "try to explore lower\ncapacity models"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2349091,
    "dDurationMs": 2859,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or shorter prompts and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2352230,
    "dDurationMs": 3505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also wanted to say a few\nwords about the use cases"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2355736,
    "dDurationMs": 2939,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in which I think LLMs are\ncurrently well suited for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2358676,
    "dDurationMs": 1964,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In particular, note that\nthere's a large number"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2360641,
    "dDurationMs": 1904,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of limitations to LLMs today,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2362546,
    "dDurationMs": 1724,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so I would keep that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2364271,
    "dDurationMs": 1904,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "definitely in mind for\nall of your applications."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2366176,
    "dDurationMs": 2399,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Models, and this by the way\ncould be an entire talk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2368576,
    "dDurationMs": 1994,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I don't have time to\ncover it in full detail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2370571,
    "dDurationMs": 2159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Models may be biased,\nthey may fabricate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2372731,
    "dDurationMs": 1154,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hallucinate information,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2373886,
    "dDurationMs": 1664,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they may have reasoning errors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2375551,
    "dDurationMs": 2939,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they may struggle in entire\nclasses of applications,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2378491,
    "dDurationMs": 1559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they have knowledge cut-offs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2380051,
    "dDurationMs": 2054,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they might not know\nany information above,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2382106,
    "dDurationMs": 1649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "say, September, 2021."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2383756,
    "dDurationMs": 1994,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are susceptible\nto a large range of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2385751,
    "dDurationMs": 3044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "attacks which are coming\nout on Twitter daily,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2388796,
    "dDurationMs": 2264,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "including prompt injection,\njailbreak attacks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2391061,
    "dDurationMs": 1694,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "data poisoning\nattacks and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2392756,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So my recommendation\nright now is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2394676,
    "dDurationMs": 2954,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "use LLMs in low-stakes\napplications."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2397631,
    "dDurationMs": 2504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Combine them always\nwith human oversight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2400136,
    "dDurationMs": 1784,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Use them as a source\nof inspiration and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2401921,
    "dDurationMs": 2414,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "suggestions and think co-pilots,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2404336,
    "dDurationMs": 1544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instead of completely\nautonomous agents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2405881,
    "dDurationMs": 1889,
    "segs": [ {
